  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FENAP Water and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide significant technical assistance and training and operational support to the Federation. The project will construct a new well in the village of Gagarouathatwill provide drinking water to over 760 people and more than 7;990 animals.</narrative>
